ps for  how to get out of changing different  words around and changing your layout so  the equipment do any easy way not  spending any money is to do the mail  merge with Excel Word and outlook if you  want to see how that's done just leave a  comment below and I can do a quick  tutorial on how to do it it's pretty  easy once you get started but I would  recommend thinking about the long term  for your business and trying to make a  little bit more investment in your  company and building an email newsletter  list through a software program like  Aweber or another company because it  can't have a serious impact on your  business and it's worth the investment  in my opinion anyway I hope that helped  if you have any questions please leave a  comment below I'd also love to hear your  your thoughts and feedback and please  give the video a thumbs up and we'll  stay tuned to the next episode  you
 

